---
/**
 * Link to the newsletter signup, for the blog post sidebar. A link rather than
 * an embedded form: the Zoho form on /newsletter is tied to that page's URL.
 */
---

<div class="sidebar-card mb-8">
  <p class="font-bold dark:text-white">Stay in the loop</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">
    A low-volume newsletter, about once a month.
  </p>
  <a
    href="/newsletter"
    class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-md border border-blue-650 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-blue-650 transition-colors hover:border-blue-800 hover:text-blue-800 dark:border-slate-400 dark:text-slate-300 dark:hover:border-white dark:hover:text-white"
  >
    Subscribe
  </a>
</div>
